CORE
main.cpp
--cpp17
^\[main\.assertion\.1\] line \d+ plain value-pack decltype resolves: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.2\] line \d+ WRONG must FAIL: FAILURE$
^VERIFICATION FAILED$
^EXIT=10$
^SIGNAL=0$
--
^CONVERSION ERROR$
--
A variadic function template whose trailing-return decltype contains a plain
by-value value-pack expansion f(a...) -- with no type parameter pack reference
in the pattern -- is expanded by replicating the pattern to the common deduced
pack length, so decltype(invk(...)) resolves to the call result type.  The
forwarding-cast form static_cast<Args&&>(a)... is handled separately via the
type pack Args (cpp11_trailing_return_fwd_pack).  N5008 [temp.variadic]/4,5.
